From 14ed883074dac0c00cfafc8b7347602a6e3c6b8e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: T S Rameshkumar <rameshkumar.t@phytecembedded.in>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 17:59:23 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 4/9] arm64: dts: freescale: Add PHYTEC phyCORE-i.MX8MM SOM
 support and base overlays

Add device tree definitions for the PHYTEC phyCORE-i.MX8MM System-on-Module
(PCM-066 / PCL-069 SOM). Configure 2GB LPDDR4 memory node, PMIC regulators,
eMMC storage, SPI NOR flash, and Gigabit Ethernet PHY. Add base SOM overlays
for disabling Ethernet, SPI flash, and enabling RPMSG.

Signed-off-by: T S Rameshkumar <rameshkumar.t@phytecembedded.in>
---
 .../dts/freescale/imx8mm-phycore-no-eth.dtso  | 12 ++++
 .../freescale/imx8mm-phycore-no-spiflash.dtso | 16 +++++
 .../dts/freescale/imx8mm-phycore-rpmsg.dtso   | 55 ++++++++++++++++
 .../dts/freescale/imx8mm-phycore-som.dtsi     | 64 +++++++++----------
 4 files changed, 113 insertions(+), 34 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 arch/arm64/boot/dts/freescale/imx8mm-phycore-no-eth.dtso
 create mode 100644 arch/arm64/boot/dts/freescale/imx8mm-phycore-no-spiflash.dtso
 create mode 100644 arch/arm64/boot/dts/freescale/imx8mm-phycore-rpmsg.dtso

